        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "第1問",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>第1問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の進め方</strong><p>最初にLとdL、gとモルをそろえます。(3)は酸素結合割合の低下分、(5)は消費量÷肺へ入る量です。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"7.5\\times10^2\\,\\mathrm{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4.5\\times10^{-2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>モル</dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"9.0\\times10^{-3}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>モル</dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"5.4\\times10^{-2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>モル</dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"17\\%\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section><p class=\"prose\">(1) 5.0 Lは50 dLなので、ヘモグロビン量は次の通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b365ad6e7b79\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解答</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"15\\times50=7.5\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(2) 1 g当たりの最大結合量を掛けます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b365ad6e7b79\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解答</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"6.0\\times10^{-5}\\times7.5\\times10^2=4.5\\times10^{-2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(3) 心臓から出たとき100%、全身を回った後80%なので、20%が消費されます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b365ad6e7b79\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解答</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"4.5\\times10^{-2}\\times0.2=9.0\\times10^{-3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(4) 6.0 Lの20%が酸素で、22.4 Lが1モルです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b365ad6e7b79\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解答</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{6.0\\times0.2}{22.4}=5.4\\times10^{-2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(5) 消費量を肺へ入る酸素量で割り、100を掛けます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b365ad6e7b79\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解答</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"100\\times\\frac{9.0\\times10^{-3}}{5.4\\times10^{-2}}=17\\%\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>第2問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の進め方</strong><p>10題は独立です。最初に因数分解、対称性、約数、二項確率など短い型を拾い、重い積分・三角方程式は後回しにします。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2,\\pm{}i,\\pm{}2i\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>5</dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>4</dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd>41桁</dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd>6組</dd></div><div><dt>(6)</dt><dd>2</dd></div><div><dt>(7)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac14\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(8)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{343}{8192}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(9)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=y=\\frac\\pi4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(10)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\sqrt3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section><p class=\"prose\">(1) x-2をまとめ、残りをx²の2次式として因数分解します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-421b43a4998a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)〜(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(x-2)(x^2+1)(x^2+4)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(2) PはABを直径とする円上を動き、XはPでの接線上を動きます。最小距離は中心Cから接点までの半径です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-421b43a4998a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)〜(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"C=\\frac{a+b}{2}=(2,1),\\qquad AC=5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"a2-tangent-circle\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"点A・Bを直径とする円、中心C、円周上の点Pと接線上の点Xを示す図（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.800\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>点A・Bを直径とする円、中心C、円周上の点Pと接線上の点Xを示す図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">(3) y=xとy=(x+sin x)³は奇関数です。3√|x|だけが偶関数として残ります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-421b43a4998a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)〜(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2\\int_0^1 3\\sqrt{x}\\,dx=4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(4) 25^119が167桁なので10^166≦25^119&lt;10^167です。指数を29/119倍して25^29を挟みます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-421b43a4998a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)〜(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"10^{40}&lt;25^{29}&lt;10^{41}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(5) 積が18になる整数の因数組を列挙します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-421b43a4998a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)〜(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(2x-9)(y+2)=18\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(6) 合同な面をもつ四面体を図示し、底面の高さOH=2、高さCS=2を得ます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-4f32a55cf01b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)・(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V=\\frac13\\left(\\frac12\\cdot3\\cdot2\\right)\\cdot2=2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"a2-tetrahedron\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"底面三角形OABと、垂線CS・STを含む四面体OABCの補助図（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.800\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>底面三角形OABと、垂線CS・STを含む四面体OABCの補助図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">(7) 回転体の体積をlog pの2次関数として整理します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-4f32a55cf01b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)・(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac1\\pi V(p)=\\int_1^2(\\log p+\\log x)^2\\,dx\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-4f32a55cf01b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)・(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=(\\log p+2\\log2-1)^2+\\text{定数}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">平方部分が0のとき最小です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-4f32a55cf01b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)・(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\log p=1-2\\log2=\\log\\frac e4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(8) 最初の4回で7がちょうど1回、5回目に7が出る並びです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c290c5a802a5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)・(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"{}_4C_1\\frac18\\left(\\frac78\\right)^3\\frac18=\\frac{343}{8192}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(9) 第2式を和積公式で変形し、定義域から(x+y)/2=π/4を得ます。第1式も和積公式と三倍角公式で変形します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c290c5a802a5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)・(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac\\pi4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c290c5a802a5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)・(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"u=\\sin\\frac{x-y}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c290c5a802a5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)・(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"4u(u-1)(u+1)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">0&lt;y≦x&lt;πより(x-y)/2=0を選びます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c290c5a802a5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)・(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=y=\\frac\\pi4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">中心を結ぶ線と共通接線でできる直角三角形からPQ=4√3です。半径比2:6を使う相似でPRを求めます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6c2d89f668f6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(10)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2:6=PR:(PR+4\\sqrt3)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6c2d89f668f6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(10)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"PR=2\\sqrt3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"a2-tangent-circles\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"外接する円C1・C2、共通接線l、接点P・Q、中心線との交点Rを示す図（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.852\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>外接する円C1・C2、共通接線l、接点P・Q、中心線との交点Rを示す図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第3問",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>第3問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の進め方</strong><p>円を平方完成して中心と半径を読み取ります。中心のt表示、半径平方、tの恒等式、円周角の順に前問をつなぎます。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\left(x-(t-1)\\right)^2+\\left(y+\\frac t2\\right)^2=r^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"r^2=\\frac54t^2-4t+4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">中心は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(x,y)=(t-1,-t/2)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を消去します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"y=-\\frac12x-\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(2) 半径平方をtの平方で完成します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"r^2=\\frac54\\left(t-\\frac85\\right)^2+\\frac45\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t=\\frac85\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"C=\\left(\\frac35,-\\frac45\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(3) 円の式をtの恒等式と見て、tの係数と定数項を0にします。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"-2x-y+2=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x^2+y^2+2x-3=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"A\\left(\\frac15,-\\frac85\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"B(1,0)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(4) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> では <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AP\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> が直径なので <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle ABP=90^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AP\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"PB\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を求めます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"AB=\\frac{4\\sqrt5}{5},\\qquad AP=\\sqrt5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"PB=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{5}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1724dd92a390\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)〜(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"[PAB]=\\frac12\\cdot AB\\cdot PB=\\frac65\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"a3-circle-triangle\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"円周上の点A・B・Pがつくる直角三角形ABPを示す図（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.800\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>円周上の点A・B・Pがつくる直角三角形ABPを示す図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">中心は平方完成、最小半径はtの2次関数、固定通過点は恒等式、面積は直径に対する円周角を使う、という役割分担です。</p></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-04",
        "label": "第4問",
        "order": 4,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-04\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-04\"><h2>第4問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の進め方</strong><p>5個の例を列挙して規則を確認し、最後に1個食べる場合と2個食べる場合へ分けます。一般項は特性方程式の2根、極限は絶対値の大きい根で割ります。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">(1) 1と2の和が5になる順序付き列を数えると8通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ff6a1c38aeca\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)・(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a_5=8\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(2) 最後に1個食べる前はn-1個、最後に2個食べる前はn-2個を食べ終えています。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ff6a1c38aeca\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)・(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a_n=a_{n-1}+a_{n-2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">特性方程式の2根をα=(1-√5)/2、β=(1+√5)/2とします。漸化式を2本の等比型へ変形します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a_{n+1}-\\alpha a_n=\\beta^{n+1}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a_{n+1}-\\beta a_n=\\alpha^{n+1}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">2式の差から一般項を得ます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a_n=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\left(\\beta^{n+1}-\\alpha^{n+1}\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"A=\\sqrt5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"B=\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2},\\qquad C=\\frac{1-\\sqrt5}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1&lt;B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-1&lt;C&lt;0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので、分母分子を大きい方の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"B^{n+1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で割ります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\frac{B-C(C/B)^{n+1}}{1-(C/B)^{n+1}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">|C/B|&lt;1より、その累乗は0へ収束します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=B=\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></div></article>"
      }
    ]
